{"id":"d5649903f3f896c7","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pdbfextclass.md","title":"Horn and threshold extensions of partial functions","display":"thm-pdbfextclass — Horn and threshold extensions of partial functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pdbfextclass","aliases":["27-thm-pdbfextclass"],"display":"thm-pdbfextclass — Horn and threshold extensions of partial functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]","[[27-df-extension]]","[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.3.4 Theorem 12.12; §12.3.5 threshold extensions","source_printed_pages":"535–539","source_pdf_pages":"559–563","verification_status":"source-statements-checked-Horn-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pdbfextclass"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pdbfextclass</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pdbfextclass — Horn and threshold extensions of partial functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.3.4 Theorem 12.12; §12.3.5 threshold extensions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"535–539"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"559–563"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-checked-Horn-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；扩张见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>，书籍 Horn 类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>，阈值类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 使用通常实数运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i\">\\(w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_i\\right)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid\\emptyset\\ne A\\subseteq F\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_i\\right)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid\\emptyset\\ne A\\subseteq F\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\cap T=\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\cap T=\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall x\\in T\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F\\;(w\\cdot y&lt;\\theta)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall x\\in T\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F\\;(w\\cdot y&lt;\\theta)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书 Horn DNF 约定修正为规定假点的交闭包。若闭包避开 T，令扩张假点集恰为该闭包即可；反向由每个 Horn 假点集交闭。阈值半空间可用有限样本间隙在 f=1 iff w·x≥θ 与原书 f=0 iff w·x≤t 两种约定间转换；T 或 F 为空时用常函数处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；扩张见 [[27-df-extension]]，书籍 Horn 类见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]，阈值类见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\mathbb R$ 使用通常实数运算，$w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；扩张见 [[27-df-extension]]，书籍 Horn 类见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]，阈值类见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\mathbb R$ 使用通常实数运算，$w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；扩张见 [[27-df-extension]]，书籍 Horn 类见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]，阈值类见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\mathbb R$ 使用通常实数运算，$w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-extension]]、[[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-extension]]、[[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-extension]]、[[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext},\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\prod_{x\\in A}x_i\\right)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid\\emptyset\\ne A\\subseteq F\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{cl}_{\\wedge}(F)\\cap T=\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\cap\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall x\\in T\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F\\;(w\\cdot y<\\theta)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2044,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-506","locations":["正文"],"count":